      Data: Cornelius6
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I knew you'd say that, very well. Ancient texts describe an artifact
        that may be the first piece of this mysterious puzzle, which lies deep in
        the forest islands. I shall meet you further into the forest, I am confident
        you will be capable of reaching me. For now, I bid you adieu.
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
